d=Text("For regular adult retail customers, SBI, HDFC Bank, and ICICI Bank are all showing a one-year rate of 6.25% for the relevant retail deposit bucket [1][6][9].",variant="body")
e=Card([f])
f=Column([g,h,i,j],"sm",padding=16)
g=Text("Assumed deposit sizes","h2")
h=Text("SBI: Retail domestic term deposits below ₹3 crore; the one-year slab is 1 year to less than 2 years and the rate is 6.25% for general customers.",variant="body")
i=Text("HDFC Bank: Domestic/NRO/NRE fixed deposits below ₹3 crore; the one-year slab is 1 year to less than 15 months and the rate is 6.25% for regular customers.",variant="body")
j=Text("ICICI Bank: Retail deposits below ₹3 crore; the one-year slab is 1 year to less than 18 months and the rate is 6.25% for general customers [17].",variant="body")
k=Card([l])
l=Column([m,n,o,p],"sm",padding=16)
m=Text("Rate dates","h2")
n=Text("SBI: The bank page shown is the retail domestic term-deposit page with the current revised grid; the page content indicates the current retail slab structure and the source snapshot used here reflects the live rate table.",variant="body")
o=Text("HDFC Bank: The rate table is explicitly marked applicable from 19 August 2026 for domestic/NRO/NRE fixed deposits below ₹3 crore.",variant="body")
p=Text("ICICI Bank: The source snapshot used here reflects the current retail FD grid, and the cited third-party rate page states the one-year retail rate at 6.25% for deposits below ₹3 crore.",variant="body")
q=Card([r])
r=Column([s,t,u,v],"sm",padding=16)
s=Text("Premature-withdrawal caveats","h2")
t=Text("SBI: The cited SBI retail page provides the rate grid but does not spell out a premature-withdrawal penalty in the extracted text shown here, so the exact penalty should be checked in SBI’s current deposit terms before booking.",variant="body")
u=Text("HDFC Bank: For deposits booked on or after 22 July 2023, premature withdrawal, including sweep-in/partial withdrawal, is charged at 1% below the rate on the date of deposit booking for the actual period the deposit remained with the bank, rather than the contracted rate; certain government-related entities may be exempt on eligible branches and documents.",variant="body")
v=Text("ICICI Bank: The cited current FD rate snapshot shows the one-year retail rate, but the displayed source excerpt here does not include the bank’s premature-withdrawal penalty text, so that condition should be verified in ICICI Bank’s deposit terms before booking.",variant="body")
w=Card([x])
x=Column([y,z],gap="md",padding=16)
y=Text("Quick view","h2")
z=Table(columns=[{key:"bank",label:"Bank"},{key:"rate",label:"One-year retail FD rate"},{key:"size",label:"Assumed deposit size"},{key:"date",label:"Rate date / effective date"}],statePath="/quick_view_data",domain="comparison",preferredPresentation="cards",primaryColumn="bank",numericColumns=["rate"])
y=Text("If you want, I can also turn this into a stricter like-for-like comparison using only the banks’ own official pages and exact effective-date wording.","caption")
